I think the main weakness of krakens in nethack is that they can't get
out of the water and have no ranged attacks -- and by the time the
player meets them, they've already learned to kill sea critters from a
distance.

Also, they're really slow.

My suggestion for beefing up krakens would be to speed them up to at
least normal speed and give them a ranged grab attack which pulls the
player (or, just for fun, any unlucky monster in the way) next to the
kraken and makes them stuck like the current grab attack (with the
risk of drowning on the next turn).

If the tile on the side of the kraken facing you also happens to be
water, then, well, too bad... :)

